/see ![x](a.png "t/") now/
%% ^^^ carveItalic
%%                      ^^^ carveItalic

/see ![x](a.png 't/') now/
%% ^^^ carveItalic
%%                      ^^^ carveItalic

/see [x](foo(bar)/baz) now/
%% ^^^ carveItalic
